# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmarks {#benchmarks}"
msgstr "Penanda Aras {#benchmarks}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The benchmarks below show that the Constrained Quantum Optimizer Quantum Function is capable of finding high quality, feasible solutions to constrained optimization problems with well above 100 binary variables. Accuracy is the ratio of the found objective value to the known optimum. Runtime is wall-clock time from function invocation to result delivery. QPU usage is the billable Quantum Compute time.\n"
msgstr "Penanda aras di bawah menunjukkan bahawa Constrained Quantum Optimizer Quantum Function mampu mencari penyelesaian berkualiti tinggi dan boleh laksana untuk masalah pengoptimuman terkekang dengan jauh melebihi 100 pemboleh ubah binari. Ketepatan (accuracy) ialah nisbah nilai objektif yang ditemui kepada optimum yang diketahui. Masa jalan (runtime) ialah masa jam-dinding daripada panggilan fungsi hingga penyampaian hasil. Penggunaan QPU ialah masa Pengkomputeran Kuantum yang boleh dicaj.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Two problems were examined: The [Maximum Independent Set](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) (MIS) problem and the Max-$k$-Cut, which is an extension of the well-known MaxCut problem to more than two categories. Max-$k$-Cut is also the optimization problem equivalent of the graph coloring decision problem (when all edges are cut, the graph is $k$-colorable).\n"
msgstr "Dua masalah dikaji: masalah [Maximum Independent Set](/tutorials/find-the-maximum-independent-set-with-aqarios-constrained-quantum-optimizer) (MIS) dan Max-$k$-Cut, iaitu lanjutan bagi masalah MaxCut yang terkenal kepada lebih daripada dua kategori. Max-$k$-Cut juga merupakan masalah pengoptimuman yang setara dengan masalah keputusan pewarnaan graf (graph coloring) (apabila semua tepi dipotong, graf itu boleh diwarna-$k$).\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29 · verified 2026-10-01
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Problem               | Variables | Constraints | Qubits | Accuracy | Feasibility | Total runtime (s) | QPU usage (s) | Total shots |\n"
"|-----------------------|-----------|-------------|--------|----------|-------------|-------------------|---------------|-------------|\n"
"| MIS es60fst02         | 186       | 280         | 124    | 100.0%   | True        | 940.2             | 147.0         | 25.0k       |\n"
"| MIS sloane\\_2dc\\_128  | 128       | 5173        | 74     | 100.0%   | True        | 347.6             | 106.0         | 12.5k       |\n"
"| Max-3-Cut Karate Club | 99        | 33          | 99     | 98.7%    | True        | 279.5             | 166.0         | 25.0k       |\n"
"| Max-4-Cut Karate Club | 132       | 33          | 132    | 100.0%   | True        | 258.3             | 200.0         | 25.0k       |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Masalah               | Pemboleh ubah | Kekangan | Qubit | Ketepatan | Kebolehlaksanaan | Jumlah masa jalan (s) | Penggunaan QPU (s) | Jumlah shot |\n"
"|-----------------------|-----------|-------------|--------|----------|-------------|-------------------|---------------|-------------|\n"
"| MIS es60fst02         | 186       | 280         | 124    | 100.0%   | True        | 940.2             | 147.0         | 25.0k       |\n"
"| MIS sloane\\_2dc\\_128  | 128       | 5173        | 74     | 100.0%   | True        | 347.6             | 106.0         | 12.5k       |\n"
"| Max-3-Cut Karate Club | 99        | 33          | 99     | 98.7%    | True        | 279.5             | 166.0         | 25.0k       |\n"
"| Max-4-Cut Karate Club | 132       | 33          | 132    | 100.0%   | True        | 258.3             | 200.0         | 25.0k       |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Benchmark Notes {#benchmark-notes}"
msgstr "Nota Penanda Aras {#benchmark-notes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The above results were obtained on the `ibm_marrakesh` Heron r2 processor with default options and `use_session` enabled. For the `sloane_2dc_128` instance, `total_shots=12500` was used.\n"
msgstr "Hasil di atas diperoleh pada pemproses Heron r2 `ibm_marrakesh` dengan pilihan lalai dan `use_session` diaktifkan. Untuk instans `sloane_2dc_128`, `total_shots=12500` telah digunakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The reduced qubit count for MIS instances (74 and 124 versus 128 and 186 variables) reflects variable fixing in preprocessing.\n"
msgstr "Bilangan qubit yang dikurangkan untuk instans MIS (74 dan 124 berbanding 128 dan 186 pemboleh ubah) mencerminkan penetapan pemboleh ubah dalam prapemprosesan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The problem instances for MIS are taken from the [Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://doi.org/10.1038/s43588-026-00991-1). - The instance for the Max-$k$-Cut problem is the [Zachary Karate Club graph](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zachary%27s_karate_club), which has a chromatic number of 5.\n"
msgstr "Instans masalah untuk MIS diambil daripada [Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://doi.org/10.1038/s43588-026-00991-1). - Instans untuk masalah Max-$k$-Cut ialah [graf Zachary Karate Club](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zachary%27s_karate_club), yang mempunyai nombor kromatik 5.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "A note on QPU time {#a-note-on-qpu-time}"
msgstr "Catatan tentang masa QPU {#a-note-on-qpu-time}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The QPU time a function run needs depends strongly on the chosen options, the number of warm-start iterations, and shots. With the default options, the function needs considerably less QPU time than standard QAOA, because it uses iterative warm-starting instead of a variational parameter training loop on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Masa QPU yang diperlukan oleh larian fungsi sangat bergantung pada pilihan yang dipilih, bilangan lelaran mula-panas, dan syot. Dengan pilihan lalai, fungsi ini memerlukan masa QPU yang jauh lebih sedikit daripada QAOA standard, kerana ia menggunakan mula-panas lelaran dan bukannya gelung latihan parameter variasi pada QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an example, both approaches were compared  on `ibm_phoenix` using Maximum Independent Set instances that correspond to function sizes `M` and `L`. A [standard QAOA workflow](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm) needed about 130 and 200 seconds of QPU time, respectively. The function with default options needed about 30 seconds in both cases. Results for other problems and settings will differ.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai contoh, kedua-dua pendekatan dibandingkan pada `ibm_phoenix` menggunakan instans Maximum Independent Set yang sepadan dengan saiz fungsi `M` dan `L`. [Aliran kerja QAOA standard](/tutorials/quantum-approximate-optimization-algorithm) memerlukan masing-masing kira-kira 130 dan 200 saat masa QPU. Fungsi dengan pilihan lalai memerlukan kira-kira 30 saat dalam kedua-dua kes. Hasil untuk masalah dan tetapan lain akan berbeza.\n"

